{"id":"00333","root":"uni00333_1","name":{"ja":"陽炎","en":"Kagero"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"陽炎","en":"Kagero"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2020-05-15","limited":false,"characterId":219,"profile":{"ja":"報われぬ愛に殉ずる女。逸刀流を破門された対魔忍剣士、村雲源之助の陰となり日向となり尽くしている。回復系忍法「回春の術」の使い手で、その真骨頂は病身の相手と交わり子宮内で血肉の薬を生み出す「換血薬胎」。従って非処女で、長きにわたる術の使用のために、この先普通の子供を産むことも出来なくなっている。その術で、魔界由来の肉腫に蝕まれた源之助の症状を抑えてきたが、それもすでに限界。遠くない死を待つばかりとなり、死に場所を求める村雲源之助にどこまでも寄り添うも、その愛が報われることはない哀しき女。戦いにおいては小太刀を扱い、源之助に手ほどきを受けた逸刀流で戦うが、その腕前は対魔忍としては普通の域を出ない。","en":"Kagero is a woman who sacrifices herself for an unrequited love. She is a Taimanin swordswoman expelled from the Ittō-ryū, now serving as the shadow and constant sun to Murakumo Gennosuke. She wields the healing ninjutsu \"Rejuvenation Technique,\" whose pinnacle is the \"Blood-Exchange Elixir\" that she creates within her womb by mingling with a sickly opponent, producing a medicinal concoction of flesh and blood. Consequently, she is not a virgin, and prolonged use of the technique has rendered her unable to bear ordinary children in the future. She has used this art to suppress the demon-origin sarcoma afflicting Gennosuke, but even that has reached its limit. Facing an imminent death, she remains by Gennosuke's side as he searches for a place to die, though her love will never be returned, making her a sorrowful figure. In battle she handles a short sword, fighting with the Ittō-ryū style taught by Gennosuke, but her skill remains average for a Taimanin."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"鹿瀬紫卯","forms":[{"id":"uni00333_1","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1084,2168],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[113,226],"def":[139,278],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"skills":["2","580007"]},{"id":"uni00333_2","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1668,3336],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[161,322],"def":[213,426],"spd":[57,57],"luck":[1,90]},"spCharge":38,"ski